{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_fortify","model_identifier":"spell_fortify","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_fortify\n\nSupport-mage fortify: six small translucent gold shield-plates standing round a unit at waist height (radius 16 u, y 24-38).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -17..17, y 26..36, z -16..16 units (0.96 x 0.30 x 0.92 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 18.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 34 x 10 x 33 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rise` | 0.6 | once | plates rise from the ground to waist height while turning into place (holds at 0.6 s) |\n| `fade` | 0.5 | once | plates drift outward and up as they fade (alpha is the game's) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_plate0, glow_plate0_boss, glow_plate0_rim, glow_plate1, glow_plate1_boss, glow_plate1_rim, glow_plate2, glow_plate2_boss, glow_plate2_rim, glow_plate3, glow_plate3_boss, glow_plate3_rim ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_plate0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[15.5,26.0,-3.5],"to":[16.5,36.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,31,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.5,0.0,9.5,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.5,0.0,7.5,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.5,0.0,9.5,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.5,0.0,7.5,10.0],"texture":0